{"version":2,"sourceHash":"8ba562241517e1e324fbb5326f4ec69210a15b0a6dae5c333b57fe04c2e0c36e","locale":"zh-TW","id":"ep-21a","no":"EP.21A","tag":"EP.21A · 想不起的名字","title":"想不起的名字","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-21a:1","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi悄悄走出熟睡的房間。關門前，他回頭看了一眼。Yeoni踢開被子，張著嘴睡著。","bg":"library2","tone":"dark","bgm":"neo2","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:2","s":"neo","t":"蓋好被子再睡。感冒了，又要怪客服吧。","x":"soft","l":null,"c":{"who":"neo","x":"soft"},"r":null},{"id":"ep-21a:3","s":"n","t":"他用前爪夾住被角，拉到Yeoni肩頭。Yeoni翻了個身，把那隻前爪當枕頭，抱進懷裡。"},{"id":"ep-21a:4","s":"neo","t":"放手。我不是枕頭。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:5","s":"n","t":"Yeoni沒鬆開。Yeongnyangi就這樣趴了許久，才極慢地抽出前爪，塞了一本書進去代替。"},{"id":"ep-21a:6","s":"neo","t":"抱歉。今天這本書代班客服。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-21a:7","s":"n","t":"沒有回答。Yeoni只在夢裡，含糊地說了一句，一星。Yeongnyangi輕輕笑了。"},{"id":"ep-21a:8","s":"n","t":"上樓時，他把肩膀靠在牆上。左爪又不聽使喚了。","sfx":"thud"},{"id":"ep-21a:9","s":"n","t":"他抬起前爪。紅鏽沿著焦痕蔓延。落水之後，鏽每天長出一指節。","im":true,"shot":"close","fx":"metal","scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"metal","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:10","s":"neo","t":"遇火燒焦，遇水生鏽。金屬也真難照顧。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:11","s":"n","t":"他用斗篷下襬蓋住鏽跡。明早也不能讓Yeoni看見。雖然摩卡和閏月已經發現，不過那兩人嘴很嚴。"},{"id":"ep-21a:12","s":"n","t":"不對，水獺不嚴。今天下午，那條尾巴，大概什麼都說了。"},{"id":"ep-21a:13","s":"n","t":"雨的氣味從樓梯窗飄進來。每次聞到，Yeongnyangi腦海裡，就有什麼喀噠打開，又合上。","bgm":"memWater","scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:14","s":"n","t":"雨中的車站。雨水從舊屋簷下，連成線落下。","bg":"rainStop","tone":"desat","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"rainStop","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: rainStop","transition":"crossfade","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"rainStop 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:15","s":"n","t":"某個人的手，握著傘。是一隻小手。傘傾斜一半，朝向身旁的人。"},{"id":"ep-21a:16","s":"n","t":"傘下，有人笑著。淋著雨，傻乎乎的，卻無比開心。","im":true,"shot":"close","sfx":"rain","scene":{"background":"rainStop","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: rainStop","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"rainStop 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:17","s":"n","t":"一起撐吧。記憶裡，有人這樣說。Yeongnyangi想抓住那個聲音，可手裡抓到的，只有雨水。"},{"id":"ep-21a:18","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi把額頭抵在冰冷的牆上。記憶總到這裡為止。握傘的手。那是誰的手，旁邊又站著誰。","bg":"library2","tone":"dark","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:19","s":"neo","t":"要是知道名字就好了。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:20","s":"sys","t":"[ 契約第一條 · 守護者不得說出自己的名字 · 名字被喚出的瞬間，契約即告終結 ]","im":true,"fx":"script","sfx":"glitch","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"library2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: library2","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"script","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"library2 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:21","s":"n","t":"金色文字在眼前浮現，又消失。那是客服的規則。也是當初接下這份工作時，他親手簽下的規則。"},{"id":"ep-21a:22","s":"neo","t":"我知道。從來沒忘。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:23","s":"n","t":"他忘了自己的名字。卻沒有忘記，捨棄那個名字，是為了換來什麼。"},{"id":"ep-21a:24","s":"neo","t":"再一次就好。這一次，一直陪在身邊，到最後。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-21a:25","s":"n","t":"他看著樓梯窗映出的自己。深藍帽子，泛著金光的紫眼睛，生鏽的前爪。那是戴帽子的貓的臉。"},{"id":"ep-21a:26","s":"neo","t":"第一次用這張臉睜開眼，她看著我，問我是不是普通的貓。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:27","s":"n","t":"然後，她打了分。一星。Yeongnyangi至今仍清楚記得，那天收到的一星。明明連自己的名字都想不起來。"},{"id":"ep-21a:28","s":"n","t":"屋頂上，風很大。被吞去一半的太陽，掛在夜空。那是既非白晝，也非黑夜的天空。","bg":"eclipseSky","tone":"dark","bgm":"stillLake","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-21a:29","s":"n","t":"屋頂盡頭，坐著黑虎。彷彿從一開始，就在等他。"},{"id":"ep-21a:30","s":"tiger","t":"來晚了，貓。","x":"base","l":{"who":"neo","x":"serious"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"tiger","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-21a:31","s":"neo","t":"聞到雨味，就來看看。這次又想偷誰的書。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:32","s":"tiger","t":"今天不是來工作的。有話對你說。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-21a:33","s":"neo","t":"對豬說話不客氣，對我也不客氣。妳會對誰恭恭敬敬呢。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:34","s":"tiger","t":"別問沒用的問題。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:35","s":"neo","t":"對帳簿的主人嗎。對那個聲音。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:36","s":"tiger","t":"閉嘴。那個聲音，現在也在聽。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:37","s":"n","t":"老虎瞥了一眼天空。半輪太陽的黑色一側，極緩慢地蠕動著。"},{"id":"ep-21a:38","s":"n","t":"老虎的紅眼，落到Yeongnyangi的左爪上。準確地找到了，斗篷下襬蓋住的鏽跡。"},{"id":"ep-21a:39","s":"tiger","t":"那隻爪子。每天蔓延一指節，對吧。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-21a:40","s":"neo","t":"妳怎麼知道。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:41","s":"tiger","t":"帳簿上全記著。每次你在那孩子身邊受傷，她那一欄，就有一行變得更重。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-21a:42","s":"neo","t":"別動她那一欄。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:43","s":"tiger","t":"動的不是我。是你。她的火越大，你越會熔化。你越硬撐，她就越渺小。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:44","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi沒回答。兩人都知道，他無話反駁。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:45","s":"tiger","t":"離開吧。現在走，她還能靠七格活下去。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-21a:46","s":"neo","t":"七格，會變成容器。妳也知道吧。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:47","s":"tiger","t":"你，怎麼知道那個。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-21a:48","s":"neo","t":"就算看不了帳簿，我也會看天。被吞掉的太陽想要什麼，我還是看得出來。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:49","s":"n","t":"雨滴開始落在兩人之間。明明天很晴，只有他們站著的地方下起了雨。","sfx":"rain"},{"id":"ep-21a:50","s":"neo","t":"不過，妳的雨味，我好像以前聞過。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-21a:51","s":"tiger","t":"錯覺。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:52","s":"neo","t":"雨傘。車站。一起撐吧，那句話。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:53","s":"n","t":"老虎的尾巴重重拍在地上。雨水飛濺。","im":true,"fx":"water","sfx":"thud","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"water","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:54","s":"tiger","t":"別說那個。你沒資格談那個春天。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:55","s":"neo","t":"那就沒錯了。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:56","s":"neo","t":"我們來自同一個春天。","x":"serious","bgm":"crisis2","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 neo의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-21a:57","s":"n","t":"老虎沒回答，卻抬起前爪，緊緊握住頸上的金環。明明金環什麼也沒做。"},{"id":"ep-21a:58","s":"tiger","t":"想不起來，就別裝知道。那最殘忍。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:59","s":"neo","t":"我想不起來。所以才問。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:60","s":"tiger","t":"我全都記得。一點不漏。所以，才會這樣活著。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:61","s":"neo","t":"那個春天，發生了什麼。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:62","s":"tiger","t":"你說要保護的人，消失了。就這樣。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-21a:63","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi的前爪一顫。生鏽的地方，突然灼痛起來。記憶還沒回來，身體已經先痛了。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:64","s":"neo","t":"原來如此。難怪這一次，我接下了這份工作。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-21a:65","s":"tiger","t":"這次，也會一樣結束。你又遲到，我又獨自留下。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-21a:66","s":"tiger","t":"別問了。我憑什麼回答一隻連名字都不知道的貓。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-21a:67","s":"neo","t":"彼此彼此。我也不知道妳的名字。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:68","s":"n","t":"風吹過。Yeongnyangi眼眸深處，金光驟起，又消失。那道光，連他自己也沒察覺。","im":true,"fx":"veil","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"veil","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-21a:69","s":"tiger","t":"你剛才的眼睛。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-21a:70","s":"neo","t":"別在意。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-21a:71","s":"tiger","t":"在空格前，也是那雙眼睛。你自己也不知道，還是裝不知道。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-21a:72","s":"neo","t":"客服不回答私人問題。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-21a:73","s":"n","t":"這時，下方傳來開窗聲。極其小心，卻又像豬會做的那樣，還是有點吵。"},{"id":"ep-21a:74","s":"n","t":"白貓與黑虎同時轉頭。窗框上，掛著一隻粉紅色前蹄。","im":true,"shot":"impact","sfx":"door","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}}]}
